    "notes": "tracklist:\n\n(1929) Sleepy John Estes - The Girl I Love, She Got Long Curly Hair\n(1930) Marc Williams 'The Cowboy Crooner' - Curly Joe\n(1932) Paul Robeson - Ma Curly-Headed Baby\n(1934) Callahan Brothers - She's My Curly Headed Baby\n(1935) Riley Puckett - Curly-Headed Baby\n(1939) Vasilis Tsitsanis + Stratos Payioumtzis - To katsaro sou to malli (Your Curly Hair)\n(1940) Fats Waller + His Rhythm - Little Curly Hair in a High Chair\n(1949) Arthur Askey - Ev'ry Little Piggy's Got a Curly Tail\n(1949) James Moody Quartet - Curly Top Blues\n(1952) Big Bill Broonzy - Coal Black Curly Hair\n(1952) Roy 'Bald Head' Byrd (aka Professor Longhair) - Curly Haired Baby\n(1955) The Sons of the Pioneers - Curly Joe from Idaho\n(1958) Ensemble Piatnitsky + Balalaikas - Curly Head\n(1958) Ted Heath + His Music - Ma Curly Headed Baby Cha Cha\n(1960) Theodore Bikel - Chupchik (Curly Forelock)\n\ntotal time: 43'27\n\n\nCurled by Lucky.\nCover by Lucky.\nDedicated to my curly baby.",
